  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ben Yiriwa Womens Association of Fougako/Goualala (Association Ben Yiriwa des Femmes de Fougako /Goualala)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will enable Ben Yiriwa to improve its production output by clearing the land, constructing wells, acquiring simple tools, providing an initial fund for improved production inputs, and obtaining technical assistance and training in business management and literacy training.</narrative>
  </description>
